Use Case :
Review PR changes in a GitHub repo.

Compare them against best practices (style, security, performance).

Suggest inline fixes and improvements.

Approve or reject the PR with a reason.



Technical Skill Stack :

| Component                    | Purpose                                                                |
| ---------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Python 3.9+                  | Core scripting language for automation & agent logic.                  |
| GitHub REST API / PyGithub   | Fetch PR details, commits, diffs, and post reviews.                    |
| Mistral LLM (API)            | Natural-language understanding and code review reasoning.              |
| LangChain**                  | Orchestration layer for prompt templates, chains, and retrieval.       |
| RAG (FAISS + HuggingFace)    | Retrieve org-specific code standards, policies, and review checklists. |
| sentence-transformers        | Generate embeddings for documents (policies, best practices).          |
| FAISS                        | Vector database for fast similarity search during retrieval.           |
| Docker (optional)            | Containerize the review agent for CI/CD pipelines.                     |


